{
  "about": "A map change or a teleport on the same map closes what only a packet or an action of the moment opens (issue #1367): the storage (no CZ_CLOSE_STORE 0x0193 is sent, the server has quit it already) after a warp to the same map and to another one, and a Magnifier's list (nothing sent for it). The inventory, opened before, stays open.",
  "account": "",
  "slot": 0,
  "steps": [
